    <forceEntry id="f3a9-c3d0-403b-08e9" name="Mechanicum Taghmata (Allied Contingent)" hidden="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="eb14-00a7-e5fc-25be" name="Army List" hidden="false">
          <description>Strategy Rating 3. Formation initiative 2+.
3 Support Detachments may be taken per Line Detachment.
A detachment may choose up to four upgrades, each only once, and only one transport option.
Up to 1/3 of the army's points may be spent on Allies or Lords of War.
Only one Archmagos Prime may be included in the army.
Cohesive allies: Legion Astartes, Knight Household, Legio Titanicus.
Disruptive allies: Imperial Militia, Solar Auxilia.
Allied Contingent: formations here count towards the primary army's Allies &amp; Lords of War allowance. Supreme Commanders must come from the primary army.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
